          "python",
          "Confusion Matrix and Metrics Comparison\n=================================================================\n\nIsolation Forest:\n  Confusion Matrix: TP=38, FP=12, FN=12, TN=938\n  Precision: 0.7600 (of predicted anomalies, how many are real)\n  Recall: 0.7600 (of real anomalies, how many are caught)\n  F1 Score: 0.7600\n\nLOF:\n  Confusion Matrix: TP=40, FP=10, FN=10, TN=940\n  Precision: 0.8000 (of predicted anomalies, how many are real)\n  Recall: 0.8000 (of real anomalies, how many are caught)\n  F1 Score: 0.8000\n\nOne-Class SVM:\n  Confusion Matrix: TP=35, FP=15, FN=15, TN=935\n  Precision: 0.7000 (of predicted anomalies, how many are real)\n  Recall: 0.7000 (of real anomalies, how many are caught)\n  F1 Score: 0.7000"
        ]
