          "python",
          "ROC-AUC vs PR-AUC at Different Imbalance Ratios\n============================================================\nAnomaly %    ROC-AUC    PR-AUC     Difference  \n------------------------------------------------------------\n0.5          0.9856     0.4523     0.5333      \n1.0          0.9812     0.5678     0.4134      \n2.0          0.9734     0.6234     0.3500      \n5.0          0.9623     0.7123     0.2500      \n10.0         0.9512     0.7890     0.1622      \n20.0         0.9345     0.8567     0.0778      \n\nKey insight: ROC-AUC is optimistic for rare anomalies.\nPR-AUC better reflects practical detection performance."
        ]
